
         You Do Not Need A BBS to Use This Program!

EVC - The Excelsior! BBS Virus Checker    By Kenneth Brill   (c)1993
               (and others)                      Valhalla BBSware
                                                         
 A DOS program to interact with Virus Checker from a shell, needs no BBS at
all and SHOULD run under ANY BBS program out there.
                        
Thanks to Wouter van Oortmerssen for the E language and the D program
source.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

A DOS Command that interfaces with Virus Checker v6.3x to check files
inside  of LHA, LZH, DMS, ect files.  Mainly for BBSs but usable without one.
                   
